                    <TextBlock FontSize="17" LineHeight="28" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,20" Foreground="#FF2B2F36" >Donec quis aliquam nisi. Mauris lacinia tortor at augue suscipit, vitae blandit dolor suscipit. In hac habitasse platea dictumst. In imperdiet condimentum ipsum et iaculis. Maecenas lobortis sit amet turpis dignissim fringilla. Vestibulum quis nulla arcu. Nam eu sem nisl. Quisque dapibus lorem et tortor faucibus, ut scelerisque metus elementum. Donec pretium nulla id tristique convallis. Nullam ligula erat, posuere vel posuere id, scelerisque sit amet est. Cras malesuada lectus a mauris efficitur mollis. Vestibulum ante ipsum primis in faucibus orci luctus et ultrices posuere cubilia curae; Sed tincidunt dignissim lectus at condimentum.</TextBlock>
                    <StackPanel Margin="0,20,0,16">
                        <Border Width="44" Height="4" CornerRadius="2" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
                            <Border.Background><LinearGradientBrush StartPoint="0%,0%" EndPoint="100%,0%"><GradientStop Color="#FFE63946" Offset="0"/><GradientStop Color="#FFF4A261" Offset="1"/></LinearGradientBrush></Border.Background>
                        </Border>
                        <TextBlock Text="Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit" FontSize="27" FontWeight="Bold" LineHeight="34" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,12,0,0" Foreground="#FF111418"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock FontSize="17" LineHeight="28" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,20" Foreground="#FF2B2F36" >Vestibulum ac turpis egestas, vestibulum nibh a, tristique magna. Aliquam lobortis placerat nulla et tincidunt. Nullam tristique lacinia lectus id fermentum. Ut imperdiet felis sit amet ultricies sodales. Integer nec tortor interdum, vestibulum urna sit amet, sodales odio. Nam semper eleifend luctus. Sed nunc ante, viverra in felis placerat, egestas fermentum elit. Ut id tempus diam. Aenean suscipit urna ac enim ullamcorper congue. Sed ut placerat sem, et dignissim lacus. Curabitur condimentum felis ac purus imperdiet sodales. In hac habitasse platea dictumst. Proin non orci tincidunt, mattis augue non, blandit enim.</TextBlock>
                    <!-- Key takeaways -->
                    <Border CornerRadius="16" Padding="22" Margin="0,8,0,32" BorderBrush="#FFF3D9C4" BorderThickness="1">
                        <Border.Background><LinearGradientBrush StartPoint="0%,0%" EndPoint="100%,100%"><GradientStop Color="#FFFFF4EA" Offset="0"/><GradientStop Color="#FFFDE8EF" Offset="1"/></LinearGradientBrush></Border.Background>
                        <StackPanel>
